+    /// frame for the next.
+    ///
+    /// A row is kept when its cells or lines differ from last frame's -- the selection, search and link
+    /// highlights, a palette change and reverse video all land in the cells, so they are seen -- when the
+    /// cursor was or is on it or a cursor motion sweeps it, when it blinks, when @p repaintAll says so, when
